## 🗄️ Database Schema

### Core Tables

#### `accounts` Table

```sql
CREATE TABLE accounts (
  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  user_id UUID REFERENCES profiles(id),
  account_type_id INTEGER REFERENCES account_types(id),
  account_number VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,
  capital DECIMAL NOT NULL,                    -- Gross investment amount
  transaction_date TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,       -- Investment start date
  end_date TIMESTAMPTZ,                        -- Investment maturity date
  status VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,                 -- 'active', 'mature', 'closed'
  is_rollover BOOLEAN,                         -- Rollover account flag
  parent_account_id INTEGER,                   -- Reference to parent account
  admin_fee_applied BOOLEAN,                   -- Whether admin fee was charged
  rollover_sequence INTEGER,                   -- Rollover generation number
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL
);
```

#### `fix_rate_accounts` Table

```sql
CREATE TABLE fix_rate_accounts (
  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  account_id INTEGER REFERENCES accounts(id),
  annual_rate DECIMAL NOT NULL,               -- Annual interest rate
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL
);
```

#### `profiles` Table

```sql
CREATE TABLE profiles (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,                        -- References auth.users.id
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
  username TEXT,
  full_name TEXT,
  avatar_url TEXT,
  website TEXT
);
```

