## 📊 Data Flow Examples

### Example 1: New Investor Registration & Investment

```typescript
// 1. User registers and creates profile
const profile = await createProfile(userEmail);

// 2. User makes initial investment
const newAccount = {
  user_id: profile.id,
  capital: 1_000_000_000, // Rp 1B gross
  annual_rate: 0.17, // 17% annual
  is_rollover: false,
  admin_fee_applied: true,
  status: "active",
};

// 3. System calculates:
const adminFee = 1_000_000_000 * 0.05; // Rp 50M
const netCapital = 1_000_000_000 - 50_000_000; // Rp 950M working
```

### Example 2: Investment Rollover Process

```typescript
// 1. Original investment matures
const originalAccount = {
  id: 1,
  capital: 1_000_000_000,
  admin_fee_applied: true,
  status: "closed", // No longer active
};

// 2. Calculate maturity value
const maturityValue = calculateNPV(950_000_000, 0.17, startDate, endDate);
// Result: ~Rp 1,100,000,000

// 3. Create rollover account
const rolloverAccount = {
  capital: 1_100_000_000, // Full maturity value
  parent_account_id: 1, // Reference to original
  is_rollover: true,
  admin_fee_applied: false, // No additional fee
  status: "active",
};

// 4. Portfolio calculation:
// - Excludes original account (ID: 1) from active investments
// - Includes rollover account (full 1.1B working)
// - Includes original admin fee (50M) in total fees
```

### Example 3: Portfolio Summary Calculation

```typescript
// Given: User has original investment + rollover
const portfolioData = [
  { id: 1, capital: 1000000000, is_rollover: false, status: 'closed', admin_fee_applied: true },
  { id: 2, capital: 1100000000, is_rollover: true, status: 'active', parent_account_id: 1, admin_fee_applied: false }
];

// System calculation:
