  totalGrossInvestedFund: 1_100_000_000,      // Only active rollover
  totalNetInvestedFund: 1_100_000_000,        // No admin fee on rollover
  totalAdminFees: 50_000_000,                 // From original parent account
  activeInvestments: 1,                       // Only rollover account
  totalNetPresentValue: calculateNPV(...)     // Real-time value
};
```

